name issue_127_all_v2_no_stall
describe every v2 switch on, 1200 kbps, 120 ms delay, 30 ms jitter (reordering) and 2% loss for 60 s: no render stall without an outage (issue #139, #127)
duration 60s
cc v2
pacer v2
rtx v2
keyframe v2
allocator v2
audio v2
# packetization v2 and audio v2 added on 2026-10-20 (#152, Owner): the flip (#61) turns on all nine v2 switches.
packetization v2
at 0s capacity=1200kbps delay=120ms jitter=30ms loss=2% queue=150ms
# #139: seeds 7, 9 and 12 of 12 had an 8-13 s render stall (pause_count > 0) with no outage; the default stack had none.
# Seeds 1-12 on main d2461d5: video.pause_count 0 on all, longest freeze 225-1444 ms.
expect video.pause_count == 0
expect video.residual_loss_pct < 1
